  <jpcrp_cor:ReferenceToOtherInformationStrategy contextRef="FilingDateInstant">第１　企業の概況－５　従業員の状況 ―(4)②</jpcrp_cor:ReferenceToOtherInformationStrategy>
  <jpcrp_cor:ReferenceToOtherInformationMetricsAndTargets contextRef="FilingDateInstant">第１　企業の概況－５　従業員の状況 ―(4)②</jpcrp_cor:ReferenceToOtherInformationMetricsAndTargets>
  <jpcrp030000-asr_E00880-000:RiskManagementHumanCapitalTextBlock contextRef="FilingDateInstant">
&lt;p style="margin-left: 32px; text-align: left"&gt;〔リスクと機会〕&lt;/p&gt;
